    "innovation": "This paper identifies that reduced decadal prediction skill in the tropical Pacific is caused by an initialization shock, which stems from a spurious trend in the assimilated wind stress data that unrealistically displaces the thermocline and triggers artificial El Ni\u00f1o/La Ni\u00f1a events during the forecast.",
